595
00:31:25,050 --> 00:31:27,210
<font face="Tahoma" size="24"><b><b><font face="Palatino Linotype"><font size="22">İzninizleeeeeeeee!</font></font></b></b></font>

596
00:31:29,450 --> 00:31:32,600
<font face="Tahoma" size="24"><b><b><font face="Palatino Linotype"><font size="22">Bunta! Bunta gibi mi olmaya çalışıyorsun!?</font></font></b></b></font>

